# Live-test artifacts — regenerated every run, read once, never diffed.
# The .txt half was missed when the .png rule was written, so eight result
# logs sat untracked for three sessions looking like real files.
test/live/_*.png
test/live/_*.txt

# Database dumps taken before a migration or a reconcile. REAL BACKUPS, kept
# on disk on purpose — but they are the steward's own 415-book catalogue, and
# a public repo is not where a person's library contents belong. Nothing here
# is deleted; it simply never enters history, which is the one place you
# cannot take something back out of.
archive/db-backups/
